      "describe_ch": "人因工程與實驗設計是一門結合生理學、心理學、電腦、工業設計、工業安全等領域的統整性學科。此課程為以實驗為主的應用學科，課程實施將側重於方法論與實驗。",
      "describe_en": " Human factors engineering is an integrated discipline that combines physiology, psychology, computer, industrial design, industrial safety and other fields. This course is an experiment-based applied subject, and the implementation of the course will focus on methodology and experimentation."
