    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpb_seq": 1,
    "tpb_book": "<div>網路教材：</div>\n\n<div>Berlin, C and Adams C 2017 Production Ergonomics: Designing Work Systems to Support Optimal Human Performance. London: Ubiquity Press. DOI: https://doi.org/10.5334/bbe. License: CC-BY 4.0</div>\n\n<div>傳統教材：</div>\n\n<div>Sanders, M.S. and Ernest, J., 1993. McCormick. Human factors in engineering and design, seventh edition, McGraw-Hill. 本書已出版多年，但仍為人因工程領域相當廣泛使用之教課書，因此本學期本課程仍沿用此書。由於人因工程為一實驗科學，因此閱讀要領在於理解課程中所提及之實驗方法、目的、及以圖表表示之實驗結果。</div>\n",
    "tpb_book_en": null
  },
